ent-PaperCCTCMiningVesselPurchase = CCTC mining vessel procurement form
    .desc = A single-use CCTC voucher for acquiring a mining vessel from a standard shipyard console.

ent-PaperCCTCTransportVesselPurchase = CCTC transport vessel procurement form
    .desc = A single-use CCTC voucher for acquiring a transport vessel from a standard shipyard console.

paper-cctc-mining-vessel-purchase = CREON-CENTENNIAL TRADE CHARTER
    MINING VESSEL PROCUREMENT FORM

    Applicant: ______________________________________
    Charter registration: ___________________________
    Operating sector: _______________________________

    Approved purpose: MINING OPERATIONS ONLY
    The requested vessel must be configured for ore extraction, mining equipment, and ore transport.
    Passenger service and general cargo transport are not authorized under this form.

    REDEMPTION: Insert this document into a standard shipyard console.
    This authorization permits one vessel from the approved mining list at no charge.

    Requested vessel class: __________________________
    Mining equipment package: ________________________
    Approving officer: _______________________________
    Signature: _____________________  Date: __________

paper-cctc-transport-vessel-purchase = CREON-CENTENNIAL TRADE CHARTER
    TRANSPORT VESSEL PROCUREMENT FORM

    Applicant: ______________________________________
    Charter registration: ___________________________
    Operating sector: _______________________________

    Approved purpose: TRANSPORT OPERATIONS ONLY
    The requested vessel must be configured for cargo delivery and authorized passenger transport.
    Ore extraction and dedicated mining equipment are not authorized under this form.

    REDEMPTION: Insert this document into a standard shipyard console.
    This authorization permits one vessel from the approved transport list at no charge.

    Requested vessel class: __________________________
    Cargo or passenger capacity: _____________________
    Approving officer: _______________________________
    Signature: _____________________  Date: __________
